  cookingInstructions:
  - Chop the pork belly into sliced
  - Chop the chicken liver into sliced
  - Chop the kikiam into sliced
  - Chop the garlic into minced
  - Chop the onion into sliced
  - Chop the cabbage into sliced
  - Chop the carrot  into sliced
  - Chop the bell peppers into sliced
  - Chop celery into minced
  - Turn the stove to medium heat
  - Put the pan in the stove
  - Add 1 tbsp of cooking oil
  - Add pork belly in the pan
  - Add chicken liver
  - Add the sllice kikiam
  - Add shrimp
  - Saute it using the spatula
  - Add the minced garlic in the pan
  - Add the sliced onion in the pan
  - Saute until translucent
  - Add the sliced carrots in the pan
  - Add the sliced cabbage in the pan
  - Add the sliced bell peppers in the pan
  - Saute it using the spatula
  - Add the chicken broth
  - Add 1/4 cup of soy
  - Add 1/4 cup of oyster sauce
  - Add 1 tbsp  of fish sauuce
  - Put the pan lid to simmer
  - Add 1/8 tsp of pepper
  - Add pancit canton noodles
  - stir it using the spatula
  - Add minced celery into the pan
